|---|---|
| **Theorem U** | **ACCEPT**, with minor notation corrections |
| **Theorem Uθ** | **ACCEPT WITH FIXES** — repair the regime-overlap span |
| **Theorem Uθ′** | **ACCEPT** for the stated \(K\)-block variant |
| **Proposition O′** | **REJECT as written** — constant-target counterexample; optimality claim also needs repair |